        "textcol_iEbKaD": {
          "type": "textcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "<p>Once you’re qualified, we don’t leave you hanging. As one of the UK’s top-rated training  providers, <strong>we’ve built partnerships with leading gyms across the country </strong>— including The Gym Group, Virgin Active, and more. <strong>Learners get access to guaranteed job interviews,</strong> giving you a clear pathway into paid employment, check out our <a href=\"/blogs/news\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Fitness and Personal Training Education\">Career Support page</a> to learn more.</p>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-m",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": true,
            "right_text": "<p>Want a career that<strong> pays well, fits around your life, and doesn’t require a university degree</strong>? Becoming a Wellness Personal Trainer opens the door to flexible, rewarding jobs that <strong>keep you active, fulfilled, and in control of your time.</strong> Whether you want to work in gyms, run sessions in the community, coach clients online, or build your own wellness brand, it all starts here.</p>",
            "right_text_size": "copy-m",
